  "evidenceBoundary": {
    "exact": "Current named Decode registration and direct callers establish header reads, enlarged record strides, added anonymous trailing words, shape-userdata fields and separate actor/registry identities. Strict parser bounds and EOF remain policy, not native length proof.",
    "direct": "The native hit writer copies physics ID/version from masked actor userdata. A distinct registry resolver reads the recorded packed entity. The shape ordinal is not a component-type bit index.",
    "structuralOnly": "Authored packed collider definitions and mesh-reference slot order; anonymous flag/mesh words retain raw bits.",
    "conditional": "The five source labels come from the selected current constructor descriptor/publication and slot-3 assignments. This is an independent collision-source proof, not a revalidation of the wider Streaming field-2 contract or runtime callback receipt.",
    "unresolved": "Saved query hit actors lack userdata/registry snapshots, so physics IDs cannot be joined to live owning entities or CAB/PathID; definitions do not prove live instance selection."
  },
